    "text": "🚨🚨🚨 Breaking: SpaceX plans to push through their first contingency checkpoint on Starship Flight 15, and continue in orbit toward a catch attempt Saturday.\n\nThey also said Booster 22's catch abort was an automated call by the booster, due to a GNC issue.\n\nPhoto credit: SpaceX",
